  "details": "I have a quest 2 and i played vrchat for a couple of weeks i used to be a pc user before i got a quest 2. One day i decided to use my pc instead of a quest 2 after playing vrchat on pc the next day i played on my quest 2 and i couldnt move my arms i switched into a different avatar then it allowed me to move my arms. But if i switched my avatar again i couldnt move my arms so i had to keep switching and switching through avatars so i could move my arms. I thought this glitch would be fixed through an update but i had this glitch for 3 weeks now and im getting tired of switching avatars",
